<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl pb-12">
  <%!-- Header + intro — always visible --%>
  <div class="mb-6">
    <h1 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold">Bytecraft Collective</h1>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <div>
        <p class="text-darkGrey text-sm">Domyślne konto</p>
        <p class="mt-0.5 font-medium">
          <code class="rounded bg-orange-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-sm text-orange-800">
            kira@bytecraft.collective
          </code>
          <span class="text-darkGrey mx-1">/</span>
          <code class="bg-grey-100 rounded px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm">kolejka123456</code>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-darkGrey text-right text-sm">
        <div>Kira Voss · Lead Architect</div>
        <div class="text-xs">admin / superuser · B2B</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-grey-100 text-grey-700 mt-4 flex flex-col gap-8 border-t pt-4 text-sm">
      <p>
        Pięcioosobowy software house z Warszawy. Trzy projekty komercyjne (<em>GhostPet</em>, <em>FlatMate</em>, <em>TacoOverflow</em>) + wewnętrzny <em>Firmowid</em>. Cztery waluty, egzotyczne konto THB, integracja KSeF. Trzy miesiące historii — M-2 i M-1 zamknięte, M-0 do dopasowania.
      </p>
      <p class="font-bold">Wykorzystaj tę organizację do testów - poniżej wszystkie
        informacje.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Sections --%>
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <%!-- 1. Zespół --%>
    <div class="border-grey-200 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-white">
      <.button
        phx-click={toggle_section("team")}
        type="button"
        id="section-trigger-team"
        aria-controls="section-panel-team"
        variant="unstyled"
        class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-left [&_.section-chevron]:aria-expanded:rotate-180"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <.icon name="hero-users" class="text-darkGrey size-5" />
          <span class="font-semibold">Zespół Bytecraft Collective</span>
          <span class="text-darkGrey text-xs">5 osób</span>
        </div>
        <.icon
          name="hero-chevron-down"
          class="section-chevron text-darkGrey size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"
        />
      </.button>
      <div
        id="section-panel-team"
        role="region"
        class="grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out data-expanded:grid-rows-[1fr]"
      >
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
          <div class="border-grey-100 border-t px-5 pb-5">
            <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="min-w-full text-sm">
                <thead>
                  <tr class="border-grey-200 border-b">
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 pr-4 text-left font-medium">Użytkownik</th>
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 pr-4 text-left font-medium">Email</th>
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 pr-4 text-left font-medium">Rola</th>
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 pr-4 text-left font-medium">Stanowisko</th>
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 text-left font-medium">Umowa</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-grey-100 divide-y">
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium">Kira Voss</td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">
                      <code class="rounded bg-orange-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-orange-800">
                        kira@bytecraft.collective
                      </code>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">admin / superuser</td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">Lead Architect</td>
                    <td class="py-2">B2B</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">Tomek Briar</td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">
                      <code class="bg-grey-100 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs">
                        tomek@bytecraft.collective
                      </code>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">admin</td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">Backend Engineer</td>
                    <td class="py-2">UoP</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">Sable Orin</td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">
                      <code class="bg-grey-100 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs">
                        sable@bytecraft.collective
                      </code>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">pracownik</td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">Product Designer</td>
                    <td class="py-2">Zlecenie</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">Jules Kadar</td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">
                      <code class="bg-grey-100 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs">
                        jules@bytecraft.collective
                      </code>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">pracownik</td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">DevOps Lead</td>
                    <td class="py-2">B2B</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">Maren Solke</td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">
                      <code class="bg-grey-100 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs">
                        maren@bytecraft.collective
                      </code>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">pracownik</td>
                    <td class="py-2 pr-4">Frontend Engineer</td>
                    <td class="py-2">UoP</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <p class="text-darkGrey mt-3 text-xs">
              Hasło dla wszystkich:
              <code class="bg-grey-100 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono">kolejka123456</code>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- 2. Organizacja i konta --%>
    <div class="border-grey-200 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-white">
      <.button
        phx-click={toggle_section("org")}
        type="button"
        id="section-trigger-org"
        aria-controls="section-panel-org"
        variant="unstyled"
        class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-left [&_.section-chevron]:aria-expanded:rotate-180"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <.icon name="hero-building-office" class="text-darkGrey size-5" />
          <span class="font-semibold">Bytecraft Collective sp. z o.o.</span>
          <span class="text-darkGrey font-mono text-xs">NIP 6161525811</span>
        </div>
        <.icon
          name="hero-chevron-down"
          class="section-chevron text-darkGrey size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"
        />
      </.button>
      <div
        id="section-panel-org"
        role="region"
        class="grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out data-expanded:grid-rows-[1fr]"
      >
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
          <div class="border-grey-100 border-t px-5 pb-5">
            <div class="mt-4 text-sm">
              <span class="text-darkGrey">Adres:</span> ul. Marszałkowska 11/4, 00-624 Warszawa
            </div>

            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-2 text-sm font-semibold">Konta bankowe</h3>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="min-w-full text-sm">
                <thead>
                  <tr class="border-grey-200 border-b">
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 pr-4 text-left font-medium">Waluta</th>
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 pr-4 text-left font-medium">Bank</th>
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 text-left font-medium">IBAN</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-grey-100 divide-y">
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4 font-medium">PLN (domyślne)</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">ING Bank Śląski</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 font-mono text-xs">PL61105000997603123456789012</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">EUR</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">ING Bank Śląski</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 font-mono text-xs">PL85105000997603123456789013</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">USD</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">ING Bank Śląski</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 font-mono text-xs">PL42105000997603123456789014</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">GBP</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">ING Bank Śląski</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 font-mono text-xs">PL19105000997603123456789015</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">THB</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">Bank Millennium</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 font-mono text-xs">PL73116022020000000512345678</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- 3. Projekty --%>
    <div class="border-grey-200 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-white">
      <.button
        phx-click={toggle_section("projects")}
        type="button"
        id="section-trigger-projects"
        aria-controls="section-panel-projects"
        variant="unstyled"
        class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-left [&_.section-chevron]:aria-expanded:rotate-180"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <.icon name="hero-rectangle-stack" class="text-darkGrey size-5" />
          <span class="font-semibold">Projekty i klienci</span>
          <span class="text-darkGrey text-xs">4 projekty · 3 kontrahentów</span>
        </div>
        <.icon
          name="hero-chevron-down"
          class="section-chevron text-darkGrey size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"
        />
      </.button>
      <div
        id="section-panel-projects"
        role="region"
        class="grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out data-expanded:grid-rows-[1fr]"
      >
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
          <div class="border-grey-100 border-t px-5 pb-5">
            <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 md:grid-cols-2">
              <div class="border-grey-200 rounded-lg border p-4">
                <div class="mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                  <div class="bg-grey-400 size-2 rounded-full"></div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">Firmowid</h4>
                </div>
                <p class="text-darkGrey ml-4 text-xs">
                  Projekt wewnętrzny, brak kontrahenta. Rozliczanie kosztów infra (OVH, narzędzia).
                </p>
                <p class="text-grey-400 mt-1 ml-4 text-xs">Kira, Tomek</p>
              </div>

              <div class="border-grey-200 rounded-lg border p-4">
                <div class="mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                  <div class="bg-turquoise-500 size-2 rounded-full"></div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">GhostPet</h4>
                  <span class="bg-turquoise-100 text-turquoise-700 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs">
                    USD
                  </span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-darkGrey ml-4 text-xs">
                  Rozmowy AI ze zmarłymi zwierzakami. Klient: GhostPet Inc. (US, EIN 47-8830291).
                </p>
                <p class="text-grey-400 mt-1 ml-4 text-xs">Tomek, Maren</p>
              </div>

              <div class="border-grey-200 rounded-lg border p-4">
                <div class="mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                  <div class="size-2 rounded-full bg-green-500"></div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">FlatMate</h4>
                  <span class="rounded bg-green-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-green-700">
                    GBP
                  </span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-darkGrey ml-4 text-xs">
                  Randki dla zwolenników płaskiej Ziemi. Klient: FlatEarth Dating Ltd.
                  (GB, bez VAT — post-Brexit, odwrotne obciążenie).
                </p>
                <p class="text-grey-400 mt-1 ml-4 text-xs">Kira, Sable</p>
              </div>

              <div class="border-grey-200 rounded-lg border p-4">
                <div class="mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                  <div class="size-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500"></div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">TacoOverflow</h4>
                  <span class="rounded bg-orange-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-orange-700">
                    EUR
                  </span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-darkGrey ml-4 text-xs">
                  Klon SO, gdzie każda odpowiedź = przepis na taco.
                  Klient: TacoOverflow Inc. (DE, VAT DE317256842, odwrotne obciążenie).
                </p>
                <p class="text-grey-400 mt-1 ml-4 text-xs">Jules, Maren, Tomek</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- 4. Czasośledź / Lista płac --%>
    <div class="border-grey-200 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-white">
      <.button
        phx-click={toggle_section("timetracker")}
        type="button"
        id="section-trigger-timetracker"
        aria-controls="section-panel-timetracker"
        variant="unstyled"
        class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-left [&_.section-chevron]:aria-expanded:rotate-180"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <.icon name="hero-clock" class="text-darkGrey size-5" />
          <span class="font-semibold">Czasośledź i lista płac</span>
          <.link
            kind="unstyled"
            redirect="/czasosledz"
            class="text-turquoise-600 text-xs hover:underline"
            phx-click="noop"
            phx-value-stop="true"
          >
            /czasosledz
          </.link>
        </div>
        <.icon
          name="hero-chevron-down"
          class="section-chevron text-darkGrey size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"
        />
      </.button>
      <div
        id="section-panel-timetracker"
        role="region"
        class="grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out data-expanded:grid-rows-[1fr]"
      >
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
          <div class="border-grey-100 border-t px-5 pb-5">
            <p class="text-darkGrey my-4 text-sm">
              Stawki godzinowe, sesje pracy i ewidencja godzin dla 2 zamkniętych miesięcy.
              Bieżący miesiąc ma sesje, ale brak ewidencji — testuj kreator wysyłki.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold">Stawki godzinowe</h3>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="min-w-full text-sm">
                <thead>
                  <tr class="border-grey-200 border-b">
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 pr-4 text-left font-medium">Pracownik</th>
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 pr-4 text-left font-medium">Stawka (PLN/h)</th>
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 text-left font-medium">Uwagi</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-grey-100 divide-y">
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">Kira Voss</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4 font-mono">150,00</td>
                    <td class="text-darkGrey py-1.5 text-xs">
                      Poprzednia: 120,00 (podwyżka 3 mies. temu)
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">Tomek Briar</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4 font-mono">120,00</td>
                    <td class="text-darkGrey py-1.5">—</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">Sable Orin</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4 font-mono">100,00</td>
                    <td class="text-darkGrey py-1.5">—</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">Jules Kadar</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4 font-mono">130,00</td>
                    <td class="text-darkGrey py-1.5">—</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">Maren Solke</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4 font-mono">110,00</td>
                    <td class="text-darkGrey py-1.5">—</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-sm md:grid-cols-2">
              <div>
                <h3 class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold">Sesje pracy</h3>
                <ul class="text-darkGrey ml-4 list-disc space-y-0.5 text-xs">
                  <li>M-2 i M-1: ~30–36 sesji/mies., 2–5h, mix biuro/zdalnie</li>
                  <li>M-0: ~12 sesji (miesiąc w toku)</li>
                  <li>Każdy pracownik na swoich przypisanych projektach</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold">Ewidencja godzin</h3>
                <ul class="text-darkGrey ml-4 list-disc space-y-0.5 text-xs">
                  <li>M-2 i M-1: wysłane z podpisanymi PDF-ami</li>
                  <li>
                    M-0: <strong>brak</strong> — kreator wysyłki do przetestowania
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-grey-400 mt-3 text-xs">
              Panel admina:
              <.link
                kind="unstyled"
                navigate={~p"/zarzadzanie/projekty"}
                class="text-turquoise-600 hover:underline"
              >
                /zarzadzanie/projekty
              </.link>
              — przegląd godzin, stawek i eksport CSV.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- 5. Dashboard analityczny --%>
    <div class="border-grey-200 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-white">
      <.button
        phx-click={toggle_section("analysis")}
        type="button"
        id="section-trigger-analysis"
        aria-controls="section-panel-analysis"
        variant="unstyled"
        class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-left [&_.section-chevron]:aria-expanded:rotate-180"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <.icon name="hero-chart-bar" class="text-darkGrey size-5" />
          <span class="font-semibold">Dashboard analityczny</span>
          <.link
            kind="unstyled"
            redirect="/analiza"
            class="text-turquoise-600 text-xs hover:underline"
            phx-click="noop"
            phx-value-stop="true"
          >
            /analiza
          </.link>
        </div>
        <.icon
          name="hero-chevron-down"
          class="section-chevron text-darkGrey size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"
        />
      </.button>
      <div
        id="section-panel-analysis"
        role="region"
        class="grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out data-expanded:grid-rows-[1fr]"
      >
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
          <div class="border-grey-100 border-t px-5 pb-5">
            <p class="text-darkGrey my-4 text-sm">
              Trzy miesiące danych prezentują workflow dopasowywania i tagowania.
              Daty względne — uruchom seedy ponownie, aby odświeżyć.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-4">
              <%!-- M-2 --%>
              <div class="bg-grey-100/50 rounded-lg p-4">
                <h4 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded bg-green-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-green-700">
                    M-2
                  </span>
                  2 miesiące temu — w pełni dopasowane
                </h4>
                <div class="text-darkGrey mt-2 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-0.5 text-xs md:grid-cols-2">
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>GhostPet 5 950 $</span>
                    <span class="text-turquoise-600">projekt:GhostPet</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>FlatMate 4 480 £</span>
                    <span class="text-green-600">projekt:FlatMate</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>TacoOverflow 7 800 €</span>
                    <span class="text-orange-600">projekt:TacoOverflow</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>OVH Cloud -2 400 PLN</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">projekt:Firmowid</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>GitHub -250 $</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">:firma</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>Regus czynsz -4 500 PLN</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">:firma</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>Apple laptopy -18 000 PLN</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">:firma</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>Dell monitory -4 500 PLN</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-400 italic">bez tagu</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between md:col-span-2">
                    <span>THB freelance +150k, konwersja -50k/+4 800 PLN</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">:wewnętrzny</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between md:col-span-2">
                    <span>
                      Wynagrodzenia: Kira -4 800, Tomek -4 320, Sable -1 800, Jules -3 510, Maren -3 080 PLN
                    </span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">projekty pracownika</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <%!-- M-1 --%>
              <div class="bg-grey-100/50 rounded-lg p-4">
                <h4 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">
                  <span class="bg-turquoise-100 text-turquoise-700 inline-flex items-center rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium">
                    M-1
                  </span>
                  1 miesiąc temu — w pełni dopasowane
                </h4>
                <div class="text-darkGrey mt-2 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-0.5 text-xs md:grid-cols-2">
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>GhostPet 8 500 $</span>
                    <span class="text-turquoise-600">projekt:GhostPet</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>FlatMate 3 360 £</span>
                    <span class="text-green-600">projekt:FlatMate</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>TacoOverflow 5 850 €</span>
                    <span class="text-orange-600">projekt:TacoOverflow</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>OVH Cloud -2 400 PLN</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">projekt:Firmowid</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>OpenCode -120 €</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">:firma</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>Regus czynsz -4 500 PLN</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">:firma</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>Biuro Plus -380 PLN</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-400 italic">bez tagu</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span>Opłata bankowa -25 PLN</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">:firma</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between md:col-span-2">
                    <span>Konwersja THB -50k / +4 750 PLN</span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">:wewnętrzny</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between md:col-span-2">
                    <span>
                      Wynagrodzenia: Kira -4 500, Tomek -4 560, Sable -1 600, Jules -3 250, Maren -3 300 PLN
                    </span>
                    <span class="text-grey-500">projekty pracownika</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <%!-- M-0 --%>
              <div class="bg-grey-100/50 rounded-lg p-4">
                <h4 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded bg-orange-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-orange-700">
                    M-0
                  </span>
                  Bieżący miesiąc — głównie niedopasowane
                </h4>
                <div class="text-darkGrey mt-2 space-y-0.5 text-xs">
                  <div>
                    7 niedopasowanych transakcji (TacoOverflow, GitHub, OVH, czynsz, materiały, opłata, OpenCode)
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    1 dopasowana: GhostPet 3 400 $
                    <span class="text-turquoise-600">→ projekt:GhostPet</span>
                  </div>
                  <div>1 niedopasowana faktura kosztowa: OVH -2 400 PLN</div>
                  <div>
                    Opłata THB -150 THB (skip_invoicing)
                    <span class="text-grey-500">→ :wewnętrzny</span>
                  </div>
                  <div>4 faktury demonstracyjne KSeF (patrz niżej)</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- 6. KSeF --%>
    <div class="border-grey-200 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-white">
      <.button
        phx-click={toggle_section("ksef")}
        type="button"
        id="section-trigger-ksef"
        aria-controls="section-panel-ksef"
        variant="unstyled"
        class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-left [&_.section-chevron]:aria-expanded:rotate-180"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <.icon name="hero-document-check" class="text-darkGrey size-5" />
          <span class="font-semibold">Środowisko testowe KSeF</span>
          <span class="text-darkGrey text-xs">4 faktury demo</span>
        </div>
        <.icon
          name="hero-chevron-down"
          class="section-chevron text-darkGrey size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"
        />
      </.button>
      <div
        id="section-panel-ksef"
        role="region"
        class="grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out data-expanded:grid-rows-[1fr]"
      >
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
          <div class="border-grey-100 border-t px-5 pb-5">
            <div class="my-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
              <div>
                <span class="text-darkGrey">URL testowy:</span>
                <.link
                  kind="unstyled"
                  external="https://ap-test.ksef.mf.gov.pl/web/tokens/generate-token"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                >
                  ap-test.ksef.mf.gov.pl
                </.link>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="text-darkGrey">NIP testowy:</span>
                <code class="bg-grey-100 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono">6161525811</code>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="min-w-full text-sm">
                <thead>
                  <tr class="border-grey-200 border-b">
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 pr-4 text-left font-medium">Nr faktury</th>
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 pr-4 text-left font-medium">Stan</th>
                    <th class="text-darkGrey py-2 text-left font-medium">Opis</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-grey-100 divide-y">
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4 font-mono text-xs">01/MM/RRRR</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">
                      <span class="bg-grey-200 text-grey-700 inline-flex items-center rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium">
                        Szkic
                      </span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 text-xs">
                      NexaTech — audyt architektury + konsultacje DevOps, bez wysyłki
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4 font-mono text-xs">02/MM/RRRR</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">
                      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded bg-green-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-green-700">
                        Sukces
                      </span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 text-xs">
                      NexaTech — prototyp MVP, ma numer KSeF, zablokowana
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4 font-mono text-xs">03/MM/RRRR</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">
                      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded bg-orange-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-orange-700">
                        Wysyłka
                      </span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 text-xs">
                      NexaTech — szkolenie Elixir/Phoenix, zablokowana, Oban w trakcie
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4 font-mono text-xs">04/MM/RRRR</td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 pr-4">
                      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded bg-red-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-red-700">
                        Błąd
                      </span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-1.5 text-xs">
                      NexaTech — wsparcie wdrożeniowe, odrzucone zadanie Oban
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- 7. System tagowania --%>
    <div class="border-grey-200 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-white">
      <.button
        phx-click={toggle_section("tags")}
        type="button"
        id="section-trigger-tags"
        aria-controls="section-panel-tags"
        variant="unstyled"
        class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-left [&_.section-chevron]:aria-expanded:rotate-180"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <.icon name="hero-tag" class="text-darkGrey size-5" />
          <span class="font-semibold">System tagowania</span>
          <span class="text-darkGrey text-xs">3 kategorie</span>
        </div>
        <.icon
          name="hero-chevron-down"
          class="section-chevron text-darkGrey size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"
        />
      </.button>
      <div
        id="section-panel-tags"
        role="region"
        class="grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out data-expanded:grid-rows-[1fr]"
      >
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
          <div class="border-grey-100 border-t px-5 pb-5">
            <p class="text-darkGrey mt-4 mb-3 text-sm">
              Tagi encji kategoryzują dopasowane wpisy na dashboardzie analitycznym.
              Stosowane do dopasowanych par (transakcja + faktura)
              lub do encji z <code class="bg-grey-100 rounded px-1 text-xs">skip_invoicing</code>.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-2">
              <div class="bg-grey-100/50 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg p-3">
                <code class="bg-turquoise-100 text-turquoise-700 shrink-0 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs">
                  :project
                </code>
                <div class="text-darkGrey text-xs">
                  <strong>Tagi projektowe</strong> — przypisanie wpisu do projektu.
                  Każdy projekt automatycznie tworzy TagDefinition.
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-grey-100/50 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg p-3">
                <code class="shrink-0 rounded bg-orange-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-orange-700">
                  :company
                </code>
                <div class="text-darkGrey text-xs">
                  <strong>Firma</strong> — ogólne koszty firmy
                  (czynsz biura, opłaty bankowe, narzędzia).
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-grey-100/50 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-lg p-3">
                <code class="bg-grey-200 text-grey-700 shrink-0 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs">
                  :internal
                </code>
                <div class="text-darkGrey text-xs">
                  <strong>Wewnętrzny</strong> — przelewy wewnętrzne, konwersje walut.
                  Wyłączone z podsumowań.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-grey-400 mt-3 text-xs">
              Kategorie wzajemnie wykluczające się: wpis może mieć tagi projektowe
              LUB wbudowaną kategorię, nie jedno i drugie.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- 8. VoidStack Labs --%>
    <div class="border-grey-200 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-white">
      <.button
        phx-click={toggle_section("voidstack")}
        type="button"
        id="section-trigger-voidstack"
        aria-controls="section-panel-voidstack"
        variant="unstyled"
        class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-left [&_.section-chevron]:aria-expanded:rotate-180"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <.icon name="hero-shield-exclamation" class="size-5 text-red-400" />
          <span class="font-semibold">VoidStack Labs</span>
          <span class="text-darkGrey text-xs">testy izolacji tenantów</span>
        </div>
        <.icon
          name="hero-chevron-down"
          class="section-chevron text-darkGrey size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"
        />
      </.button>
      <div
        id="section-panel-voidstack"
        role="region"
        class="grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out data-expanded:grid-rows-[1fr]"
      >
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
          <div class="border-grey-100 border-t px-5 pb-5">
            <p class="text-darkGrey mt-4 mb-3 text-sm">
              Oddzielna organizacja do testów autoryzacji. Były stażysta Bytecrafta,
              Dragan Krypt, prowadzi 12-osobową operację z przerobionej kręgielni w Bratysławie.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 text-sm md:grid-cols-2">
              <div>
                <span class="text-darkGrey">Login:</span>
                <code class="bg-grey-100 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs">dragan@voidstack.io</code>
                <span class="text-darkGrey mx-0.5">/</span>
                <code class="bg-grey-100 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs">
                  kolejka123456
                </code>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="text-darkGrey">NIP:</span>
                <span class="font-mono">7871963656</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-grey-400 mt-3 text-xs">
              1 projekt (Shadow Protocol), 1 konto bankowe, 4 transakcji,
              1 faktura kosztowa, 1 faktura sprzedażowa.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- 9. Preview odznak bankowych --%>
    <div class="border-grey-200 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-white">
      <.button
        phx-click={toggle_section("bank-badges")}
        type="button"
        id="section-trigger-bank-badges"
        aria-controls="section-panel-bank-badges"
        variant="unstyled"
        class="flex w-full items-center justify-between px-5 py-4 text-left [&_.section-chevron]:aria-expanded:rotate-180"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <.icon name="hero-credit-card-mini" class="text-darkGrey size-5" />
          <span class="font-semibold">Preview odznak bankowych</span>
          <span class="text-darkGrey text-xs">Figma 11701:17853 · full + mini</span>
        </div>
        <.icon
          name="hero-chevron-down"
          class="section-chevron text-darkGrey size-4 transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out"
        />
      </.button>
      <div
        id="section-panel-bank-badges"
        role="region"
        class="grid grid-rows-[0fr] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out data-expanded:grid-rows-[1fr]"
      >
        <div class="overflow-hidden">
          <div class="border-grey-100 border-t px-5 pb-5">
            <p class="text-darkGrey my-4 text-sm">
              Zestaw do manualnej weryfikacji zgodności z Figmą. Zawiera też poprawione,
              jednoznacznie rozpoznawalne duplikaty z eksportu (`Neteller`, `Skrill`, `Vivid`).
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 xl:grid-cols-2">
              <div
                :for={bank <- @bank_badges}
                class="border-grey-100 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-lg border bg-[#fafafa] p-4"
              >
                <div class="min-w-0">
                  <p class="truncate text-sm font-medium">{bank}</p>
                </div>

                <div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3">
                  <.bank_badge bank={bank} size="full" />
                  <.bank_badge bank={bank} size="mini" />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
